    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101672" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφηκ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wasplike</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				183
			</span></i>; <i>pinched in at the waist like a wasp</i>, <i><span class="en">
